    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available October 26th ****Fully furnished** Sherry FitzGerald Lettings presents this newly refurbished two double bedroom one bathroom property in the sought after Cannon Mews development in the heart of Ballsbridge, Dublin 4. The property is in an excellent location just fifteen minutes’ walk from Grafton Street with the finest of amenities and transport options on your doorstep. Accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, leading into the master bedroom with large amount of built in wardrobe space, the second bedroom can be used as a home office or bedroom, it is set up with a high-quality sofa bed, this room also has a large amount of built in wardrobe space. The bathroom is beautifully decorated with white tiles, with a newly refurbished electric shower and utility cupboard. There is a cloak room just off the hallway with additional storage space. Upstairs leads to a very bright spacious dual-aspect living / dining room which receives a large amount of light through its skylight, this area is a beautifully decorated space which features a wood burning stove, exposed brickwork and Juliette balcony. There’s a separate fully fitted kitchen, including dishwasher, fridge/freezer, oven & hob. The property features a wi-fi operated heating system, wooden plantation shutters, underfloor heating in the bathroom and a beautiful sunny terrace area to the front of the house. There is one designated car park space available with your own personal EV charging point. **Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**"
      },
      {
